          "jcr:created": "Mon Feb 03 2020 18:03:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Caregivers like Baton Rouge ICU nurse James Bamber will tell you that they’re just doing their job when they make sacrifices none of us could fathom. They put their patients above themselves, doing whatever was needed to keep their patients, families and colleagues safe. It’s what makes these front-line warriors so special and why we are proud to honor them – for their service, their selflessness and their sacrifice.<br>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/acute-care/c/caregiver-stories.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\"><br>\nNOMINATE A hero for our caregiver series&nbsp;</span></a></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Dec 17 2020 20:47:14 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
